# Versus with the computer: the Setup panel (opponent / side / level rows) at the left of the mode screen, the mode list at the right.
# Layout (1400x800): main menu Versus (150,250). Setup panel x=200..600: Opponent row y=254: Two players (310), Computer (492);
#   side row y=350: White (280), Black (400), Random (520); level row y=446: Easy (280), Normal (400), Hard (520).
#   The mode list is the same with or without the computer: Standard (905,224). Back/Play at y=712 (Play 808).
wait 20
click 150 250        # Versus
wait 30
click 492 254        # Computer
wait 40
capture vs-setup-defaults       # White and Normal (the defaults), the level's one-line description
click 520 350        # Random
click 520 446        # Hard
wait 20
capture vs-setup-random-hard
click 400 350        # Black
click 280 446        # Easy
wait 20
capture vs-setup-black-easy
click 905 224        # Standard
wait 30
capture vs-setup-standard-selected   # Play appears
click 310 254        # back to Two players: the extra rows go and the list moves up, the selection stays
wait 40
capture vs-setup-two-players
